{"real": false, "dur": 63.63, "sent": [{"start": 0.4, "end": 6.55, "text": "There are two more categories I need, because textbooks don’t cover everything teachers want to teach.", "words": [{"w": "There", "s": 0.4}, {"w": "are", "s": 0.78}, {"w": "two", "s": 1.17}, {"w": "more", "s": 1.55}, {"w": "categories", "s": 1.94}, {"w": "I", "s": 2.32}, {"w": "need,", "s": 2.71}, {"w": "because", "s": 3.09}, {"w": "textbooks", "s": 3.48}, {"w": "don’t", "s": 3.86}, {"w": "cover", "s": 4.25}, {"w": "everything", "s": 4.63}, {"w": "teachers", "s": 5.02}, {"w": "want", "s": 5.4}, {"w": "to", "s": 5.78}, {"w": "teach.", "s": 6.17}]}, {"start": 6.9, "end": 11.9, "text": "The first is bonus material: things beyond the book that are still useful.", "words": [{"w": "The", "s": 6.9}, {"w": "first", "s": 7.29}, {"w": "is", "s": 7.67}, {"w": "bonus", "s": 8.06}, {"w": "material:", "s": 8.44}, {"w": "things", "s": 8.83}, {"w": "beyond", "s": 9.21}, {"w": "the", "s": 9.6}, {"w": "book", "s": 9.98}, {"w": "that", "s": 10.37}, {"w": "are", "s": 10.75}, {"w": "still", "s": 11.13}, {"w": "useful.", "s": 11.52}]}, {"start": 12.25, "end": 17.64, "text": "They’re labelled “bonus” on screen, never marked, and never needed to finish a step.", "words": [{"w": "They’re", "s": 12.25}, {"w": "labelled", "s": 12.64}, {"w": "“bonus”", "s": 13.02}, {"w": "on", "s": 13.41}, {"w": "screen,", "s": 13.79}, {"w": "never", "s": 14.18}, {"w": "marked,", "s": 14.56}, {"w": "and", "s": 14.95}, {"w": "never", "s": 15.33}, {"w": "needed", "s": 15.72}, {"w": "to", "s": 16.1}, {"w": "finish", "s": 16.48}, {"w": "a", "s": 16.87}, {"w": "step.", "s": 17.25}]}, {"start": 17.99, "end": 24.14, "text": "For example, the book has almost no school subjects, but my students want to introduce themselves.", "words": [{"w": "For", "s": 17.99}, {"w": "example,", "s": 18.37}, {"w": "the", "s": 18.76}, {"w": "book", "s": 19.14}, {"w": "has", "s": 19.53}, {"w": "almost", "s": 19.91}, {"w": "no", "s": 20.3}, {"w": "school", "s": 20.68}, {"w": "subjects,", "s": 21.07}, {"w": "but", "s": 21.45}, {"w": "my", "s": 21.83}, {"w": "students", "s": 22.22}, {"w": "want", "s": 22.6}, {"w": "to", "s": 22.99}, {"w": "introduce", "s": 23.37}, {"w": "themselves.", "s": 23.76}]}, {"start": 24.49, "end": 28.34, "text": "“I study physics,” in French, as you can see here.", "words": [{"w": "“I", "s": 24.49}, {"w": "study", "s": 24.88}, {"w": "physics,”", "s": 25.26}, {"w": "in", "s": 25.65}, {"w": "French,", "s": 26.03}, {"w": "as", "s": 26.42}, {"w": "you", "s": 26.8}, {"w": "can", "s": 27.18}, {"w": "see", "s": 27.57}, {"w": "here.", "s": 27.95}]}, {"start": 28.69, "end": 31.38, "text": "So school subjects stay in, as bonus.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 28.69}, {"w": "school", "s": 29.07}, {"w": "subjects", "s": 29.46}, {"w": "stay", "s": 29.84}, {"w": "in,", "s": 30.23}, {"w": "as", "s": 30.61}, {"w": "bonus.", "s": 31.0}]}, {"start": 31.73, "end": 34.42, "text": "The second category is the teacher addition.", "words": [{"w": "The", "s": 31.73}, {"w": "second", "s": 32.12}, {"w": "category", "s": 32.5}, {"w": "is", "s": 32.88}, {"w": "the", "s": 33.27}, {"w": "teacher", "s": 33.65}, {"w": "addition.", "s": 34.04}]}, {"start": 34.77, "end": 39.77, "text": "That’s something I choose to teach, even though it isn’t in the textbook.", "words": [{"w": "That’s", "s": 34.77}, {"w": "something", "s": 35.16}, {"w": "I", "s": 35.54}, {"w": "choose", "s": 35.93}, {"w": "to", "s": 36.31}, {"w": "teach,", "s": 36.7}, {"w": "even", "s": 37.08}, {"w": "though", "s": 37.47}, {"w": "it", "s": 37.85}, {"w": "isn’t", "s": 38.23}, {"w": "in", "s": 38.62}, {"w": "the", "s": 39.0}, {"w": "textbook.", "s": 39.39}]}, {"start": 40.12, "end": 43.2, "text": "It’s taught and marked just like book content.", "words": [{"w": "It’s", "s": 40.12}, {"w": "taught", "s": 40.51}, {"w": "and", "s": 40.89}, {"w": "marked", "s": 41.28}, {"w": "just", "s": 41.66}, {"w": "like", "s": 42.05}, {"w": "book", "s": 42.43}, {"w": "content.", "s": 42.82}]}, {"start": 43.55, "end": 46.63, "text": "My first example is “pleased to meet you.”", "words": [{"w": "My", "s": 43.55}, {"w": "first", "s": 43.93}, {"w": "example", "s": 44.32}, {"w": "is", "s": 44.7}, {"w": "“pleased", "s": 45.09}, {"w": "to", "s": 45.47}, {"w": "meet", "s": 45.86}, {"w": "you.”", "s": 46.24}]}, {"start": 46.98, "end": 52.36, "text": "The book never teaches it, but I teach it in the very first lesson.", "words": [{"w": "The", "s": 46.98}, {"w": "book", "s": 47.36}, {"w": "never", "s": 47.75}, {"w": "teaches", "s": 48.13}, {"w": "it,", "s": 48.52}, {"w": "but", "s": 48.9}, {"w": "I", "s": 49.28}, {"w": "teach", "s": 49.67}, {"w": "it", "s": 50.05}, {"w": "in", "s": 50.44}, {"w": "the", "s": 50.82}, {"w": "very", "s": 51.21}, {"w": "first", "s": 51.59}, {"w": "lesson.", "s": 51.98}]}, {"start": 52.71, "end": 57.33, "text": "The catalogue marks each item as either bonus or a teacher addition.", "words": [{"w": "The", "s": 52.71}, {"w": "catalogue", "s": 53.1}, {"w": "marks", "s": 53.48}, {"w": "each", "s": 53.87}, {"w": "item", "s": 54.25}, {"w": "as", "s": 54.63}, {"w": "either", "s": 55.02}, {"w": "bonus", "s": 55.4}, {"w": "or", "s": 55.79}, {"w": "a", "s": 56.17}, {"w": "teacher", "s": 56.56}, {"w": "addition.", "s": 56.94}]}, {"start": 57.68, "end": 62.68, "text": "That way, the system knows I’ve included it deliberately, rather than by mistake.", "words": [{"w": "That", "s": 57.68}, {"w": "way,", "s": 58.06}, {"w": "the", "s": 58.45}, {"w": "system", "s": 58.83}, {"w": "knows", "s": 59.22}, {"w": "I’ve", "s": 59.6}, {"w": "included", "s": 59.98}, {"w": "it", "s": 60.37}, {"w": "deliberately,", "s": 60.75}, {"w": "rather", "s": 61.14}, {"w": "than", "s": 61.52}, {"w": "by", "s": 61.91}, {"w": "mistake.", "s": 62.29}]}]}